[{"client_msg_id":"dfe01f30-baa0-4a59-b65c-86d0a16e1858","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私は苦手な方じゃないですけど、めんどくさすぎてやる気がおきないんですよね・・・意味があると思ってないフシがあるから","ts":"1621004308.253100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afec32a1-50d2-4f46-b104-e23f684d1054","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"評価は自己アピールしたもの勝ちみたいなところがある。しゃーないのだけど苦手なので困る。","ts":"1621004230.252300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+na"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac6d7f3b-4e90-4f96-8dc8-7be691d3394b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"期待！\n\u0026gt; 機械処理できない人事データはあまり価値があるとは言えないと思っていますね。\nこれ言われて気づきましたけど確かにそのとおりですね！","ts":"1621004125.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LGS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0608cc7-f11a-46f1-8c61-5dacb6dbd05c","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"正直、機械処理できない人事データはあまり価値があるとは言えないと思っていますね。\n2年後とかぜったい存在を忘れてると思う。\n一応、評価をいい感じにできるようにするスタートアップをやる予定なんですけど、寄り道（進撃のSIとか）してたら、構想から3年経っちゃいましたね。","ts":"1621004042.250600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dbnyw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3811e59b-1a7b-4271-8627-d8d11ec8ee66","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"金額で語れない微妙なアレを表現する場なんですかね...","ts":"1621003179.248700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Tv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf4406c-2f92-4438-ac1b-6017a1f151b5","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"正直、この嫌さ加減は年末調整を超えてる","ts":"1621001111.247400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xOS3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b9ea5af-bc6b-45ac-8268-8a0e585f2d51","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"最強の評価制度が欲しい（ラクという意味で）・・・どうすれば有効活用できるんだろう・・・","ts":"1621001045.246900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GPgL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2011df17-432b-4993-a597-716b2e5f60e0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"これみんなまじめにやっててるんですかね・・・前職も似たようなやつあったけどまったく意味を見いだせたことないんですよね。。。","ts":"1621000901.244800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hq+KG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1CEF6A9A-E49A-41F7-A697-0DA485E94E5A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"コメント、意味があればあった方がいいんですけどね。意味がなければなしの方が合理的な気がする。\nあるいはプログラマーらしく、機械処理できるかどうかの視点で考えるとかね","ts":"1621000654.243600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KB2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"345ac05c-6c43-4b4a-b1ff-9697ed213ced","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"毎回評価制度のコメントみたいなやつ書くのがつらいんだけど楽な仕組みないのかな・・・いっそなしにするパターンもありな気がするけど","ts":"1621000086.241300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6s5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f86a6807-36d5-43e3-9efd-7387d681077f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"以前は組織を変えよう！って思ってたけど、会社自体変えた方が楽だわ・・・ってのが最近の結論ですね。そこの会社じゃないとできない仕事ってホント少ない","ts":"1620984871.239900","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620984887.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mtf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"718f17f2-5fe0-4633-9a2d-c18d3216b6ed","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"目下の改善対象が仕事じゃないのでまたこれが難しいんですけどね…(ボランティア)","ts":"1620984648.238200","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1620984661.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,